# Unused LegoSim simulator backends.
#
# This project only uses two of LegoSim's vendored simulators:
#   interchiplet/    - the coordinator (phase-1/phase-2 process launcher)
#   popnet_chiplet/  - the chiplet interconnect network simulator
#
# The rest are alternative compute-side backends (gem5, GPGPU-Sim, Sniper,
# ScaleSim, MNSIM) plus upstream's demo/benchmark material. This project
# drives the NPU side from PyTorchSim/TOGSim instead, and the flash side from
# SimpleSSD-Standalone, so none of these are referenced by any config/,
# Makefile, or results/ script, and neither interchiplet's nor
# popnet_chiplet's CMakeLists depends on them.
#
# Kept deliberately: docs/ (LegoSim's own documentation) and .changed_files/
# (upstream's record of its popnet_chiplet patches) -- both small and
# relevant to the two simulators we do use.
/LEGOSIM_MICRO/gem5/
/LEGOSIM_MICRO/gpgpu-sim/
/LEGOSIM_MICRO/snipersim/
/LEGOSIM_MICRO/scale-sim-v2/
/LEGOSIM_MICRO/MNSIMChiplet/
/LEGOSIM_MICRO/benchmark/
/LEGOSIM_MICRO/artifact/
/LEGOSIM_MICRO/tasks-vgg13/

# LegoSim runtime artifacts (generated by running the coordinator)
proc_r*_p*_t*/
buffer[0-9]*_[0-9]*_[0-9]*_[0-9]*
bench.txt
delayInfo.txt
